{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"7a009eabddb45029","children":[{"parent":"7d2e00e6c3435831","children":[],"id":"14186b18cac9f999","title":"把面试不要当笔试。&nbsp;<br>一些东西懂，&nbsp;但是一定要会用自己的语言组织出来。&nbsp;<br>背面经的更高境界，应该是用自己的话把这些知识点答出来。然后又让别人感觉到你不是背出来的，是用自己的话答出来的。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"7d2e00e6c3435831","children":[],"id":"bf41e2a18b248308","title":"先大后小（先说整体的概念，然后再答里面的细节）<br>虚拟内存，是一个虚拟的内存。我们认为程序中得到的内存，都是虚拟内存，我们拿到的内存都是连续的，从0开始的。<br>如果直接使用物理内存，进程隔离过于困难。&nbsp;<br>内存碎片，非常麻烦<br>程序员直接控制物理内存麻烦。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"7d2e00e6c3435831","title":"虚拟内存"},{"parent":"7a009eabddb45029","children":[{"parent":"b6bee6b1b7df77ad","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f1aa5d17c40e589c","title":"内存地址就是内存上一个地址的唯一标识。&nbsp;用数组的下标来类比。"},{"parent":"b6bee6b1b7df77ad","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e3f26b74bf1f407e","title":"在32位系统应用程序中，&nbsp;位置标识32位，也即32个0和1.但是太长了，我们把它转换为16进制，用8个16进制数来表示"},{"parent":"b6bee6b1b7df77ad","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e571000e0fe79e69","title":"64位下，64个0和1,16个16进制数。"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"b6bee6b1b7df77ad","title":"内存地址"},{"parent":"7a009eabddb45029","children":[{"parent":"56a88a48d7196c17","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"1d4761cbe6f77942","title":"变量也有地址，在C中，其实就是我们所说的指针，有一些类型，比如int，有4个字节。这时候需要存储下来这个地址，采用的方式是存储首地址。"},{"parent":"56a88a48d7196c17","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ec381255d5ff05e5","title":"比如一个int，占用 1 2 3 4&nbsp;四个字节的位置。&nbsp;但是存储它的地址是，是存储的首字节，即1这个字节。"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"56a88a48d7196c17","title":"变量地址"},{"parent":"7a009eabddb45029","children":[{"parent":"9256baa75db10417","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"47f2f8163333decb","title":"比如一个int,占用四个字节。这四个字节是需要存储到内存上的，采用的是小端存储法"},{"parent":"9256baa75db10417","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"334e99cd6c78500c","title":"也就是数据的低位，存储到内存的低位上去。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"9256baa75db10417","children":[],"id":"1503898f979e45aa","title":"小端存储法和大端存储法：&nbsp;数据在内存上的存储方式"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9256baa75db10417","title":"变量的数据如何存储在内存上的"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7a009eabddb45029","title":"前置准备知识"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"f4d1cc84023884a5","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"095efead2159ec43","title":"指针：&nbsp;就是存储的地址"},{"parent":"f4d1cc84023884a5","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a9847fba09010b48","title":"指针变量：&nbsp;这个地址需要存储下来，这个就是指针变量。也就是一个变量专门用于存储指针，这个变量也是需要存储在内存上的。"},{"parent":"f4d1cc84023884a5","children":[{"parent":"5bc5d9d5354d0fb6","children":[],"id":"fd8e75bab9c82742","title":"其实平时我们就用指针就可以，但是理解这个指针、指针变量、<br>指针变量的内存。其实可以帮助我们更深入的理解指针是什么东西"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"5bc5d9d5354d0fb6","title":"这里自己需要画图理解一下指针变量。"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f4d1cc84023884a5","title":"指针变量"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"fe629ddb1d7c89ed","children":[{"parent":"7b3ab3cdc661920d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"22e0b081c482fe73","title":"数据类型 *指针名;"},{"parent":"7b3ab3cdc661920d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d38692e7536f29bc","title":"int *p; //&nbsp;推荐<br>int* p; //&nbsp;不推荐"},{"parent":"7b3ab3cdc661920d","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"bcadd0a19208da5e","title":"int* p1, p2,p3;<br>原因是可能造成一些困惑"},{"parent":"7b3ab3cdc661920d","children":[{"parent":"f857cd88685c3a6a","children":[],"id":"829cb90f0223692e","title":"一个比较好的变量声明方式。&nbsp;<br>数据类型&nbsp;变量名;<br><br>int[10]&nbsp; arr;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f857cd88685c3a6a","title":"顺便讲了一下C的&nbsp;声明风格问题<br>"},{"parent":"7b3ab3cdc661920d","children":[{"parent":"f6bf1ae0ae11cef8","children":[],"id":"f227db322d65e13e","title":"数据类型 *变量名;<br>char ch = 'a';<br>int *p_num = &amp;ch;<br>指针指向的类型一定要是这个类型。如果用另外一个类型来指向这种类型，未定义行为。&nbsp;&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f6bf1ae0ae11cef8","title":"声明的注意点"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7b3ab3cdc661920d","title":"声明"},{"parent":"fe629ddb1d7c89ed","children":[{"parent":"647aa11966293094","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b42a9ceed72a2036","title":"如果只声明，不初始化，这时候指针里面的值是随机的，如果直接用，访问到的可能是一个随机的地方。有可能访问到垃圾值，有可能访问到别的函数里的值，有可能导致程序崩溃。<br>所以需要对其初始化"},{"parent":"647aa11966293094","children":[{"parent":"e941708ae2c1303f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2c20bee2d8edeb36","title":"1.直接用 &amp;num，将num的地址取出给指针"},{"parent":"e941708ae2c1303f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f7f8223cb0fe9bc9","title":"2.用NULL赋值。NULL代表它不可用"},{"parent":"e941708ae2c1303f","children":[{"parent":"0ef714e0b014e01f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"31e58145ca6c4ac2","title":"int *p_num = arr;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0ef714e0b014e01f","title":"3.用其他指针赋值"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e941708ae2c1303f","title":"初始化方式"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"647aa11966293094","title":"初始化"},{"parent":"fe629ddb1d7c89ed","children":[{"parent":"88a1caa6a15fbb01","children":[{"parent":"a8a483edc3609e2b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"07ad1a24af929138","title":"这个指针我们不知道指到了哪里"},{"parent":"a8a483edc3609e2b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"fa7b53ae2c6a59a6","title":"所以使用的时候，可能取出来废值，可能取出来了其他函数里的值，也可能会导致程序崩溃"},{"parent":"a8a483edc3609e2b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"53eefaa037b21439","title":"这个就是野指针"},{"parent":"a8a483edc3609e2b","children":[{"parent":"fc693f0379f20878","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3836c5fb42d3896f","title":"指针没有初始化"},{"parent":"fc693f0379f20878","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7333a4724c160a17","title":"用一个int给指针赋值"},{"parent":"fc693f0379f20878","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"99354bf954f6316f","title":"int *p_num = 666;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"fc693f0379f20878","title":"野指针出现的多种情况"},{"parent":"a8a483edc3609e2b","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"5e48cb1262bc4761","title":"关于野指针，一定要小心。我们应该避免使用野指针"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a8a483edc3609e2b","title":"野指针"},{"parent":"88a1caa6a15fbb01","children":[{"parent":"d3b3e105ba8e1e79","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4b97d319102b161b","title":"给一个指针赋值为NULL。NULL其实就是一个特殊值：0"},{"parent":"d3b3e105ba8e1e79","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"16239ed59c8cf6ca","title":"这个空地址，不能取值，也不能赋值。如果取值赋值、会崩溃"},{"parent":"d3b3e105ba8e1e79","children":[{"parent":"fbbe329fddb9a1ac","children":[],"id":"8f2ae7708478b472","title":"int *p_num = NULL;<br>*p_num;<br>if(p_num !=NULL){<br>//&nbsp;再去操作<br>}"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"fbbe329fddb9a1ac","title":"使用指针之前，可以判断一下。如果是空指针，就不去解引用，不去赋值。"},{"parent":"d3b3e105ba8e1e79","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"d0a7dfa270e61ae0","title":"空指针明确的告知，这个位置不能使用。"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d3b3e105ba8e1e79","title":"空指针"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"88a1caa6a15fbb01","title":"两种比较特殊的指针"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"fe629ddb1d7c89ed","title":"指针变量的使用"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"5a36d0bbc0df6247","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"1a0609811168400f","title":"如果传递一个指针的时候，也是值传递。就是将指针的值复制一份传过去。&nbsp;<br>但是我们可以通过这个值，去改原数据。<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5a36d0bbc0df6247","title":"值传递"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"81a93d8d4e404e20","children":[{"parent":"a0c09e0a47ec4208","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5aa67f4722696e45","title":"数组名可以看做是一个指向数组连续空间的首地址，<br>在大多数情况下。数组名都可以看作是首指针使用"},{"parent":"a0c09e0a47ec4208","children":[{"parent":"1cbe63539a8cd7ed","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9e4c4c2baa1dc2a6","title":"给一个指针变量赋值的时候<br>int *p_num = arr;"},{"parent":"1cbe63539a8cd7ed","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"dd2447310c0bccc3","title":"函数传参的时候"},{"parent":"1cbe63539a8cd7ed","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"016ebf36c5db2b88","title":"算术运算的时候"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"1cbe63539a8cd7ed","title":"数组名哪些场景可以看做是首指针"},{"parent":"a0c09e0a47ec4208","children":[{"parent":"f53b915bab7d7859","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e334685e6c747882","title":"sizeof()&nbsp;这时候不是当做指针，是当做整个数组来的<br>sizeof(arr)"},{"parent":"f53b915bab7d7859","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9802de829e3c217c","title":"&amp;运算符的时候，这时候拿到的也是一个数组指针"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"f53b915bab7d7859","title":"哪些场景不能看做首指针"},{"parent":"a0c09e0a47ec4208","children":[{"parent":"e301abf0f6cbf8f0","children":[{"parent":"979fb220874e2e46","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c6430f9ce8147c01","title":"直接看后缀。后缀是什么就是什么"},{"parent":"979fb220874e2e46","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6d1da43dd48e4e29","title":"数组指针就是指针。&nbsp;这个指针在偏移的时候，一次会偏移数组大小个空间"},{"parent":"979fb220874e2e46","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9b1a96899ede69cc","title":"指针数组就是数组。这个数组里面存储的都是指针"},{"parent":"979fb220874e2e46","children":[{"parent":"9c1ad33fab6ba518","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"70860e96534f98a4","title":"int *p_arr[10];<br>[]优先级高，上来就决定了自己是数组。int *(其余的部分)说明是一个装指针的数组。&nbsp;&nbsp;"},{"parent":"9c1ad33fab6ba518","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"aedc2a0fd0a42965","title":"int (*p_arr2)[10];<br>这是指针。&nbsp;这个指针指向长度为10的数组。"},{"parent":"9c1ad33fab6ba518","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"798f2a0481036a10","title":"char *ptr_str[10];<br><br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"9c1ad33fab6ba518","title":"*&nbsp;和 [] 。 []优先级高，&nbsp;依据这个来认表达式是什么东西。&nbsp;<br>中文很重要，但是更重要的是，见到了式子要知道这是啥东西"},{"parent":"979fb220874e2e46","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"22px"},"id":"b4ffdbb0c6d9397e","title":"面试要会。<br>但是更重要的是写代码见到了会认，自己写会写"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"22px"},"id":"979fb220874e2e46","title":"数组指针和指针数组"},{"parent":"e301abf0f6cbf8f0","children":[{"parent":"34aa2b64317f39be","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"13cf9a9c37265e8c","title":"使用const来修饰指针。&nbsp;这时候指针有一些无法被修改的情况<br>"},{"parent":"34aa2b64317f39be","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"38af1571904fe2e0","title":"const怎么记？&nbsp; 整体修饰谁，谁就不能动"},{"parent":"34aa2b64317f39be","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ced38dc032403cf6","title":"const int *p=&amp;a;"},{"parent":"34aa2b64317f39be","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4045462caa23cd23","title":"int * const p2 = &amp;b;"},{"parent":"34aa2b64317f39be","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7c4c38ca3ca3eed6","title":"前面的概念在面试的时候考，但是对于写代码，<br>需要注意的点是：&nbsp;见到这个东西，要知道是啥意思，或者说谁不能改。"},{"parent":"34aa2b64317f39be","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"cd14511cea700659","title":"const int *const p4 = &amp;a;<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"22px"},"id":"34aa2b64317f39be","title":"constant pointer &amp; pointer to constant<br>指针常量和常量指针<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"22px"},"id":"e301abf0f6cbf8f0","title":"两个很绕的概念"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a0c09e0a47ec4208","title":"数组名是什么"},{"parent":"81a93d8d4e404e20","children":[{"parent":"807fdbc962652f20","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4958e8bd13c91890","title":"在传递的过程中，会退化成首指针"},{"parent":"807fdbc962652f20","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"44c10c122bbdc516","title":"在传参过程中，长度会被丢弃掉，我们在函数内部拿到的只有首指针。&nbsp;<br>所以一般情况下，我们传递数组的时候，会顺便传递一个长度"},{"parent":"807fdbc962652f20","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"39671ed5394c40b8","title":"传指针不是很麻烦，但是要注意的点是：&nbsp;你传的指针，指针指的是一个地址。<br>需要注意的是，这块地址到底能不能用"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"807fdbc962652f20","title":"数组作为参数传递"},{"parent":"81a93d8d4e404e20","children":[{"parent":"2f83ade6771352a4","children":[{"parent":"4049bea9bc707f38","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b8d8ee5e38136ea5","title":"加几，就是往后偏移几个内存单元。&nbsp;比如是一个int类型的指针，+2。就是往后偏移两个int"},{"parent":"4049bea9bc707f38","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"67c7cc6fce2d4aa0","title":"matrix这个数组指针的偏移，需要自己再看一下"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"4049bea9bc707f38","title":"可以进行加法"},{"parent":"2f83ade6771352a4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"051de82739e04f19","title":"减法"},{"parent":"2f83ade6771352a4","children":[{"parent":"500bbc1e20d74026","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"757258ea1d7f93e1","title":"*p++&nbsp;这个表达式一定要知道是什么意思<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"500bbc1e20d74026","title":"自增和自减"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2f83ade6771352a4","title":"指针的算术运算"},{"parent":"81a93d8d4e404e20","children":[{"parent":"6818bd3c3ae0aecc","children":[{"parent":"4b8d939a5ed75474","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9652343b03b3d21d","title":"悬空指针需要理解一下。&nbsp;简单说就是一个指针，<br>之前指向一片有效内存，后面这片内存失效了，&nbsp;这就是一个悬空指针<br>悬空指针是野指针的一种"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4b8d939a5ed75474","title":"需要注意一下返回的指针的生命周期问题。不能返回的指针指向的内存，不能用了。这时候变成了我们所说的悬空指针。"},{"parent":"6818bd3c3ae0aecc","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d877011a281fb4ec","title":"永远不要返回当前栈区的内容。&nbsp;因为当前栈区的数据，在函数调用结束之后，就会被清掉。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"6818bd3c3ae0aecc","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e168aa235ba921a4","title":"在C里面，函数不允许返回数组。<br>我们可以用指针来等价替换。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6818bd3c3ae0aecc","title":"指针作为返回值<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"81a93d8d4e404e20","title":"指针和数组"}],"root":true,"theme":"{\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"title\":\"基础曲线\",\"startType\":[],\"marginH\":24,\"marginW\":50,\"childMarginH\":24,\"childMarginW\":16,\"common\":{\"family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"italic\":false,\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"connectionStyle\":{\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#8A8A8A\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"centerTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#00A59A\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"font-size\":\"20px\",\"border-radius\":\"12px\",\"padding\":\"13px 20px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"secTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"border-radius\":\"10px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"font-size\":\"18px\",\"padding\":\"8px 14px\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"curve\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"childTopic\":{\"font-size\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"padding\":\"3px 12px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"roundBroken\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\",\"border-radius\":\"30px\"},\"id\":\"customise_efe174d4bfb5\"}","showWatermark":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"root","title":"指针基础&amp;指针与数组","version":594,"structure":"mind"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:32:38","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}